# Prettier must not try to parse files that are not valid in the language it infers.
#
# The CI "Lint" job ran `npm run format` (`nx format:write`, i.e. prettier --write) over
# the whole repository. Helm charts and Argo CD ApplicationSets are Go templates, not
# YAML, so prettier aborted with 30+ SyntaxErrors:
#   infra/helm/charts/admin/templates/deployment.yaml: SyntaxError: All collection
#     items must start at the same column (1:1)
#   infra/argocd/applications/applicationset.yaml: SyntaxError: Comments must be
#     separated from other tokens by white space characters (84:11)
# None of these files are formattable JavaScript/TypeScript/JSON/CSS.

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.next
**/.next
out
**/out

# Helm / Argo CD / Kustomize templates are Go templates rendered at deploy time.
infra/helm/charts/*/templates/
infra/helm/charts/*/charts/
infra/argocd/
infra/k8s/istio/

